@* ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Components/Layout/PassThroughLayout.razor

   A layout that renders NOTHING but its body. It exists for one page: Components/Pages/Modules/
   ModuleHost.razor (checklist task 87), which must choose its master page AT RUNTIME from the
   loaded control's MasterPageId — something @layout (a compile-time attribute) cannot express.
   ModuleHost therefore declares this layout and renders the REAL layout itself through
   <LayoutView Layout="...">, which is where the chrome, the AuthorizationOutlet and the
   master-page javascript globals come from.

   It deliberately does NOT wrap its body in <AuthorizationOutlet>: the layout rendered inside it
   does, and wrapping twice would render a denial twice.
   --------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- *@
@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@Body
